{"articleNo":"96550","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=96550&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관] 2013학년도 2학기 기말고사 간식 배부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.12.11","hit":"4730","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">생활관에서는 기말고사 기간에 학업에 열중하는 관생들을 독려하는 차원에서 아래와 같이 특식을 배부합니다.</span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 일시</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013. 12. 16(월) 17:00 ~ 19:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 장소 : 각 관 해당 식당 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 푸름관생 - 관리동 1층 푸름관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 오름관생 - 오름관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 메뉴</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 도넛 및 커피</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 방법</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">식수혈관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 찍고 받아가며, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">푸름관생 중 \"식사 안함\"을 선택하여 식비를 내지 않은 학생은</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;반드시 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신분증</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 지참하여 따로 본인 확인 후 수령 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 주의사항</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대리수령 불가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013. 12.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
